+
+        /* NO PAGE NONCE (2026-09-23, F-005), the same reasoning as gm_hub_logout_url_ajax below.
+           The nonce was baked into the page at render and dies 12 to 24 h later, so a hub left
+           open that long could never renew its token: every refresh was refused and the member
+           saw "not available". The WordPress session cookie is the real authentication here.
